[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ、今だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "煙幕、展開！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Smoke screen, deploying!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いっけえええ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here we gooo!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっし、作戦通り！\u3000あっちに引き付けられてる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Just like the plan! They're taking the bait!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "撒ききれなかった魔物も、すべて倒したわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And the ones that didn't follow—all taken down."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のうちに突っ切るよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Push through while we can!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "群れが、遠ざかっていく……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The pack is pulling back..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やった……前はダメだった所を\n今回は越せた……借りは返せた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We did it... I couldn't get past this before. But this time we made it... debt repaid!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やるね、アルビーナの嬢ちゃん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nice work, kid."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おめでとう、アルビーナ。\nでも敵影がないとはいえ、まだ油断はできないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Congratulations, Alvina. But don't let your guard down yet—the enemy could still be close."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな、気を付けて！\u3000おとりじゃなくて、\nこっちに向かってきてるのがいる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, watch out! Some of them aren't going for the decoy—they're heading straight for us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！？\u3000偽物だって気付かれたか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! They saw through it?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて数……このままだと追いつかれるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are so many... at this rate, they'll catch up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんの！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, come on!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんじゃいそりゃ！\n目ついてないのかあいつは！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is wrong with that thing?! Does it not have eyes?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、危ない！\u3000ぶつかる――！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watch out! It's going to hit us—!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃっ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aah!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんだあ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what the—?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここは俺たちに任せろ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave this to us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちが食い止めるわ！\nみんなは先に行きなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll hold them off! The rest of you, keep moving!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コルテスさんに、ウィルベルさん！？\nリアスたちも！\u3000どうしてこんな所に！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kortes? Wilbell?! And Rias too! What are you all doing out here?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "果ての大陸への到達は、あたしの夢でもあるから！\nやっぱり手助けしたくってさ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Reaching World's End is my dream too! I couldn't just sit back and watch—I had to help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたち異邦人だって、力になりたいもの！\n最後までお供するわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We wanderers want to do our part too! We're seeing this through to the end!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、それじゃああなたたちが……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But that means you'll be—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいから、早く行くんだ！\n大丈夫だ、必ず後から追いつく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just go, now! We'll be right behind you, I promise!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かった！\u3000みんな、行こう！\n全速力で駆け抜けるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Understood! Everyone, move! We push through at full speed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……行ったか。\n大口を叩いたが、やれるよな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...They're away. Bold words I said there. We can handle this, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この数……正直厳しいけど……\nでも、かっこつけたいじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly? These numbers are rough... But hey, we committed to looking cool."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだな。よし、みんな！\u3000覚悟を決めろ！\nこの船が壊れるまで、何人たりともここを通すな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha. Alright, everyone—brace yourselves! Not one of these things gets through until this ship falls apart!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先祖伝来の「船」を守る一族の戦士。\n王国から船を借り、レスナたちを追いかけてきた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A warrior from a seafaring clan who has protected ships for generations. He borrowed a vessel from the kingdom and sailed after Resna and the others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "凄腕の魔法使い。\nコルテスたちと共に、レスナたちを追いかけてきた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A talented witch who can freely soar through the skies on her broomstick. She sailed after Resna and the others alongside Kortes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル・フォル＝エルスリート",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell Voll-Ersleid"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]